-- ===== 00_header.lua =====
-- Nikita Visual Arts – nikitavisual.art
-- Touch Pad for Q-SYS: header (plugin info, brand, assets, themes, modes)
--
-- Real touch gestures on any Q-SYS UCI with no extra hardware. A native
-- Color Picker under the page reports where a finger is; this plugin reads
-- it, works out the gesture and draws its own interface on top as a
-- script-set icon. Sixteen modes, every result on a pin.

